<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Public Service/Colorado.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Public Service/Colorado.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Public Service Co of Colorado to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Goldman also raised the rating on American Electric Power Co Inc to market perform from underperform.</p>
<p>-- Colorado shares were unchanged at 39-7/8, while American Electric gained 1/4 to 42-3/8.</p>
</text>
